<urn:usf:rule:copy-on-write-construction-authority:1> <urn:usf:predicate:selectionRule> "First derive the packet's static scoped authority basis without any Evidence, ProofResult or ConstructionAuthorityGrant subject. Select only grants whose exact forWork, forPermission, authorityProfile, authorityManifestPath and scopedDependencyDigest match that current basis and whose deterministic IRI and contentDigest rederive. Zero current grants leaves the declared proofblocked state; exactly one may activate; more than one current grant is an integrity refusal. Stale grants remain valid historical semantic records and never create ambiguity." <urn:usf:graph:usf-bootstrap> .
<urn:usf:rule:copy-on-write-construction-authority:1> <urn:usf:predicate:evidenceRule> "The selected grant must identify exactly one deterministic Evidence resource for the work's current construction requirement. Its validationResultDigest, realisationBasisDigest, scopedDependencyDigest and contentDigest must rederive from the normalized candidate, and its scopedDependencyDigest must equal the current static authority basis." <urn:usf:graph:usf-bootstrap> .
<urn:usf:rule:copy-on-write-construction-authority:1> <urn:usf:predicate:proofRule> "The selected grant must identify exactly one passing ProofResult for the work's current construction obligation and algorithm. Its evidenceDigest must equal the selected Evidence contentDigest; its realisationBasisDigest and scopedDependencyDigest must match the evidence and current basis; and its deterministic IRI and contentDigest must rederive." <urn:usf:graph:usf-bootstrap> .
<urn:usf:rule:copy-on-write-construction-authority:1> <urn:usf:predicate:receiptRule> "The grant's publicationIntentDigest deterministically selects one owner-contained tracked receipt. Authenticate its closed schema, digest, profile, manifest, source, policy, member, exact additive operation, base/result source and semantic digests and post-publication graph readback. Receipt bytes are audit provenance and never enter the pre-publication authority-basis digest." <urn:usf:graph:usf-bootstrap> .
<urn:usf:rule:copy-on-write-construction-authority:1> <urn:usf:predicate:noReproofRule> "Only movement of a member of the selected work's static scoped dependency set invalidates a grant. An unrelated semantic resource, Git carrier, receipt, provider observation or sibling realization cannot force reproof, and no global digest is substituted for the scoped comparison." <urn:usf:graph:usf-bootstrap> .
